[size=5][b][color=#ef6a5a]AI Disclosure[/color][/b][/size]
Code, XML configuration and the 13 translations were written with the help of Anthropic's Claude and reviewed before release. The activation sound was generated with the ElevenLabs sound-effect generator. [b]The drone model and its texture are not AI-generated[/b]; they are a commercial asset bought from a human artist.

[size=5][b][color=#ef6a5a]Credits and Source[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Drone model and texture:[/b] "Hunter Drone Sci-Fi" by its author on [url=https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/aircraft/other/hunter-drone-sci-fi]CGTrader[/url], used under a purchased Royalty Free License. The inventory icon is a render of that same drone.
[*][b]Harmony[/b] by Andreas Pardeike.
[*]The name and the idea of a modular gadget belt are a nod to the skill loadouts of tactical looter shooters. The code, the configuration and the numbers are original.
[*]Full source on [url=https://github.com/HannaPanda/7D2D-Agent-Armory][b]GitHub[/b][/url], MIT licensed. [b]The drone assets and the sound are not covered by the MIT licence and may not be redistributed with forks.[/b] Fork freely, but bring your own model, material, icon and sound.
[/list]
